{"sha": "6aa857ebaf34141d5366b0502663d439333cb7eb4c8f76a3066985fceecb4844", "body": ["\\begin{theorem}[机械能守恒]\\label{thm:g11:mechanical-energy:conservation}", "\\index{机械能守恒}", "若物体只受其重力作用（无摩擦；其他", "力，如无摩擦轨道的支持力，与", "运动方向垂直），$E_m$ 守恒：对运动中的任意两点 $A$、$B$，", "\\[", "\\tfrac12 m v_A^2 + m g z_A = \\tfrac12 m v_B^2 + m g z_B .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由动能定理，$E_k(B) - E_k(A) = W_{AB}(\\vect P) =", "mg(z_A - z_B) = E_p(A) - E_p(B)$：$E_k$ 所增加的量等于 $E_p$ 所减少的量。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[水上滑道]\\label{ex:g11:mechanical-energy:slide}", "一个小孩从无摩擦滑道顶端由静止开始下滑，滑道高", "$h = \\qty{3.2}{m}$。以底端为参考平面，$mgh = \\tfrac12 mv^2$，于是", "$v = \\sqrt{2gh} \\approx \\qty{7.9}{m/s}$（\\qty{29}{km/h}） --- 与", "质量无关，\\emph{也与滑道形状无关}：直线形、曲线形", "或螺旋形，只有高度差起作用。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[单摆]\\label{ex:g11:mechanical-energy:pendulum}", "将单摆的摆球拉开，使其比最低点高出 $h = \\qty{12}{cm}$，", "然后释放。在两个端点处 $v = 0$；在最低点", "$mgh$ 全部转化为动能，$v = \\sqrt{2gh} \\approx \\qty{1.5}{m/s}$；", "在另一侧，摆球恰好回升到 \\qty{12}{cm} 高处。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.95, font=\\small]", "  \\coordinate (O) at (0,0); \\draw (-0.5,0) -- (0.5,0);", "  \\fill (O) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\draw[dashed, omExo] (230:2.2) arc (230:310:2.2);", "  \\draw (O) -- (230:2.2); \\draw (O) -- (270:2.2); \\draw (O) -- (310:2.2);", "  \\fill[omDef] (230:2.2) circle (2.5pt); \\fill[omDef] (270:2.2)", "    circle (2.5pt); \\fill[omDef] (310:2.2) circle (2.5pt);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (270:2.2) -- ++(1.15,0)", "    node[below] {$v_{\\max}$};", "  \\node[above left] at (230:2.2) {$v = 0$};", "  \\node[above right] at (310:2.2) {$v = 0$};", "  \\draw[dashed, omExo] (230:2.2) -- ++(-0.9,0)", "    (270:2.2) -- ++(-2.4,0);", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth] (-2.2,-2.2) -- (-2.2,-1.685)", "    node[midway, left] {$h$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 单摆在 $E_p$ 与 $E_k$ 之间相互转化：两端全为势能，", "最低点全为动能，两侧升高的高度都是 $h$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.75, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[thick] plot [smooth, tension=0.7] coordinates", "    {(0,3.2) (1.2,1.6) (2.4,0.5) (3.6,1.0) (4.6,2.0) (5.6,0.9)};", "  \\fill (0,3.2) circle (2pt) node[above right] {$A$};", "  \\fill (2.4,0.5) circle (2pt) node[below] {$B$}", "    (4.6,2.0) circle (2pt) node[above] {$C$};", "  \\draw[omExo] (-0.2,0) -- (6.0,0);", "  \\fill[omProp!75] (7.0,0) rectangle (7.45,1.6);", "  \\fill[omProp!75] (7.9,0) rectangle (8.35,0.25)", "    (8.8,0) rectangle (9.25,1.0);", "  \\fill[omDef!75] (7.9,0.25) rectangle (8.35,1.6)", "    (8.8,1.0) rectangle (9.25,1.6);", "  \\draw[omExo] (6.7,0) -- (9.6,0);", "  \\draw[dashed, omThm] (6.7,1.6) -- (9.6,1.6) node[above left] {$E_m$};", "  \\node[below] at (7.225,0) {$A$}; \\node[below] at (8.125,0) {$B$};", "  \\node[below] at (9.025,0) {$C$};", "  \\fill[omProp!75] (6.9,3.0) rectangle +(0.24,0.24);", "  \\fill[omDef!75] (6.9,2.5) rectangle +(0.24,0.24);", "  \\node[right] at (7.2,3.12) {$E_p$}; \\node[right] at (7.2,2.62) {$E_k$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 无摩擦过山车的能量柱状图：每个位置的", "$E_p$ 柱与 $E_k$ 柱叠加后总量相同，均为 $E_m$（虚线）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[跳台滑雪落地速率]\\label{ex:g11:mechanical-energy:skijump}", "一名跳台滑雪运动员以 $v_A = \\qty{25}{m/s}$ 的速度离开起跳点，落点", "比起跳点低 $\\Delta z = \\qty{40}{m}$。忽略空气阻力，", "$v_B = \\sqrt{v_A^2 + 2g\\,\\Delta z} = \\sqrt{625 + 785} \\approx", "\\qty{38}{m/s}$ --- 无需知道飞行路径。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.75, font=\\small]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,3.8) .. controls (1.2,2.7) and (1.9,2.4) .. (3.1,2.3);", "  \\draw[thick] (3.1,1.95) .. controls (4.2,1.55) and (5.5,1.0) .. (7.2,0);", "  \\draw[dashed, omThm, thick] (3.1,2.3) .. controls (4.3,2.25) and", "    (5.2,1.7) .. (5.9,0.75);", "  \\fill (3.1,2.3) circle (2pt) node[above] {$A$}", "    (5.9,0.75) circle (2pt) node[above right] {$B$};", "  \\draw[dashed, omExo] (3.1,2.3) -- (8.2,2.3) (5.9,0.75) -- (8.2,0.75);", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth] (8.0,0.75) -- (8.0,2.3)", "    node[midway, right] {$\\Delta z$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 跳台滑雪：无论从 $A$ 到 $B$ 飞行的是怎样的曲线，只有", "高度差 $\\Delta z$ 进入能量关系式。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{摩擦耗散}", "", "\\begin{definition}[耗散]\\label{def:g11:mechanical-energy:dissipation}", "离开机械能的能量称为", "\\emph{耗散}\\index{耗散}：它以热能的形式", "重新出现在相互摩擦的表面与空气中。总能量是守恒的", "（见\\cref{ch:g10:energy-conservation}）；而机械能本身则不然。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}